title: mf repo reindex
tags: [[CLI command]] Storage
kind: reference
summary: Rebuild the selected repository's indexes from its data

Discards the indexes and computes them again from the metarecords and their fields
— the repair for the index problems `mf repo check` reports. Nothing can be lost by
it, and it writes nothing to the operation log. The repository waits for it to
finish ([[Checking and reindexing a repository]]).
